---
import { skills, supportingTools } from '../data/portfolio';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section id="skills" class="section skills-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span>03</span> L’ARSENAL</p><h2>De bons outils.<br /><em>Et un esprit affûté.</em></h2></div><p>L’expérience pour bâtir des bases solides.<br />L’IA pour explorer de nouvelles possibilités.</p></div>
    <div class="skills-grid">{skills.map(skill => <article class="skill-card reveal"><div class="skill-top"><Icon name={skill.icon} /><span>{skill.number}</span></div><p class="eyebrow">{skill.category}</p><h3>{skill.name}</h3><p class="skill-description">{skill.description}</p><div class="tags">{skill.items.map(item => <span>{item}</span>)}</div></article>)}</div>
    <div class="skills-tools reveal"><p class="eyebrow">OUTILS & CMS</p><div class="tags">{supportingTools.map(tool => <span>{tool}</span>)}</div></div>
    <div class="belief-strip reveal"><span aria-hidden="true">✧</span><p>L’innovation prend tout son sens <em>quand elle devient utile à votre projet.</em></p><span aria-hidden="true">✧</span></div>
  </div>
</section>
